<title>USA: One Valley Bancorp sets 5-for-4 stock split.</title>
<headline>One Valley Bancorp sets 5-for-4 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLESTON, W.Va. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>One Valley Bancorp said Tuesday it has declared a five-for-four split of its common shares in the form of a 25 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>J. Holmes Morrison, president and chief executive officer, said shareholders of record on August 29 will receive one additional One Valley common share for every four shares held.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable on September 12 and cash will be paid in lieu of fractional shares result from the dividend, he said.</p>
</text>
